`FT86efac`!THE COLORADO MESH MESH CLIENT`!`f
`FT334155
-
`f
`a
`:top

Instead of juggling three separate apps, get one desktop client
for the three major mesh ecosystems:

`tc
Protocol | Role
--- | ---
`FT86efacMeshtastic`f | LoRa mesh
`FT22d3eeMeshCore`f | Companion radio
`FTf59e0bReticulum`f | Nomad host
`t

The Colorado Mesh Mesh Client is a cross-platform Electron app
for macOS, Linux, and Windows. Connect over BLE, USB serial,
or Wi-Fi/TCP and keep local message history in SQLite.

`FT334155
-.
